## 4. Serverless Data Lake (Athena & S3)
Athena uses a "schema on-read" approach via Apache Hive DDL, allowing us to query logs directly from S3 without expensive database compute.

**Hive DDL Syntax for CloudTrail JSON:**
```sql
CREATE EXTERNAL TABLE cloudtrail_logs (
    event_time STRING,
    user_identity STRING,
    source_ip STRING
)
ROW FORMAT SERDE 'org.openx.data.jsonserde.JsonSerDe'
LOCATION 's3://soc-telemetry-archive-el/';